Blackpool South railway station serves the suburban south of Blackpool, Lancashire, England. It is the terminus of the "South Fylde Line" and lies only a short walk from Blackpool Football Club's stadium at Bloomfield Road. It is also located about 0.5 miles from Waterloo Road tram stop on the Blackpool Tramway.

Waterloo Road tram stop is part of the Blackpool Tramway system and is approximately 0.5 miles from Blackpool South railway station. 

In summary, the relative positions are as follows: Moss Side railway station is on the Blackpool South to Preston line, with Blackpool South railway station being further west towards Blackpool. Waterloo Road tram stop is near Blackpool South railway station, making it the closest of the three locations to Blackpool.
